<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Eli Lilly upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Eli Lilly upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Everen Securities said on Tuesday it upgraded its intermediate-term rating on Eli Lilly and Co to outperform from market perform, while maintaining its long-term outperform rating on the drug manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Eli Lilly's shares were off 5/8 at 99-5/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
